  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ILAC Studie &quot;St&#xe4;rka det Syriska R&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILAC Study &quot;Strengthen the Rule of Law in Syria&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie om r&#xe4;ttss&#xe4;kerhet i Syrien.  Syftet &#xe4;r att   ta fram en gemensam analys med lokala akt&#xf6;rer och identifiera behov  och prioriteringar f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka ett enhetligt r&#xe4;ttssystem, initialt i de omr&#xe5;den som inte &#xe4;r regimkontrollerade.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To design a program for strengthen the rule of law by                  establishing a shared analysis by both local stakeholders and ILAC   regarding the needs and priorities concerning how to strengthen a     unified legal system, initially in areas not controlled by the        government.</narrative>
  </description>
